#. entranceRiddles/footer
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:27
msgctxt "tree:entranceRiddles#/footer"
msgid "after the signature and before the rights notice"
msgstr "落款之後、權利聲明以前"

#. entranceRiddles/mytu
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:27
msgctxt "tree:entranceRiddles#/mytu"
msgid "the ninth row the official record refuses"
msgstr "正式學籍不肯承認的第九行"

#. entranceRiddles/map
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:27
msgctxt "tree:entranceRiddles#/map"
msgid "the rain-opened crease in today's wooden map notice"
msgstr "今日木板被雨泡開的折痕"

#. entranceRiddles/search
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:27
msgctxt "tree:entranceRiddles#/search"
msgid "the next result left after no results"
msgstr "查無結果之後仍留著的下一筆"

#. entranceRiddles/bbs
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:27
msgctxt "tree:entranceRiddles#/bbs"
msgid "a thread with replies but no author"
msgstr "沒有作者、卻有人回覆的帖子"

#. text
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:286
msgctxt "text:text"
msgid ""
"Bell-tower repair slip: boxes one through eight verified; box nine need not "
"be completed."
msgstr "鐘樓維修單：第一至第八格已核對；第九格不必填。"

#. text
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:288
msgctxt "text:text.2"
msgid ""
"{value0} seals show through the back of the timetable; Academic Affairs "
"blames thin paper."
msgstr "課表背面有 {value0} 枚印章透了過來；教務處說紙太薄。"

#. text
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:290
msgctxt "text:text.3"
msgid ""
"A ninth roll-call row appeared and was crossed out; {value0} marks currently "
"refuse erasure."
msgstr "點名簿多了第九行，又被劃掉；目前有 {value0} 個筆跡不肯消失。"

#. text
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:292
msgctxt "text:text.4"
msgid ""
"The reverse of this page is warm for the present duty bell; moonlight leaks "
"down from {value0}."
msgstr "這一頁的紙背在本值鐘有溫度；月影從{value0}往下漏。"

#. text
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:294
msgctxt "text:text.5"
msgid ""
"Several wrong doors have worn the paper thin; the next fresh mark may pass "
"through its reverse."
msgstr "幾扇錯門已把紙磨薄；下一筆新墨可能直接穿過反面。"

#. text
#: src/js/phantasm-gate.js:295
msgctxt "text:text.6"
msgid ""
"All six seals are present, but this duty bell opens elsewhere. The lunar "
"note points to {value0}."
msgstr "六印齊了，但本值鐘的入口不在此頁。月相把它註在：{value0}。"
